t":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-04-04T11:41:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T16:39:54Z","closed_at":"2026-02-16T16:24:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105016","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105016.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105016.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-16T16:24:54Z"},"body":"~Fixes (not anymore) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/52162~\r\n~Fixes (not anymore) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86132~\r\n\r\nThe LSP types were not added at the right time, so they were not picked up at some places e.g. by the doctools (internal documentation recognized them though).\r\n\r\nThis PR binds them at the correct time to get picked up by the doc tools. The classes are now marked as experimental, the amount of internals that is exposed makes implementation of new LSP features while keeping behavior of all those methods infeasible.\r\n\r\nIn addition this PR marks some methods as deprecated:\r\n- Methods that have the primary purpose of interacting with connected clients: The LSP is not meant to be extendable and usage of those methods isn't possible in a meaningful way, since there is no way to actually obtain information about the connected clients\r\n- Methods that directly implement an LSP endpoint: Those had to be exposed due to how JSONRPC functioned before #104890 . They are not save to access as public API though for two reasons:\r\n    1. They expect to be communicating with an compliant LSP client, so users would have to ensure to follow the LSP lifecycle when using those, it's unlikely that they will.\r\n    2. Some of those methods rely on context from the networking code (which peer is processed at the moment). When accessing those methods not through the networking code this context isn't set correctly, which could lead to incorrect behavior.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105016/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105016/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}